## Preamble

Mathematics is one of the oldest and most freely shared of human
inheritances. This license exists so that this Work can serve only life:
the people who inherit it and the natural environment that sustains them.
The conditions below are not an afterthought; they are the reason this
Work is offered at all. By Using the Work you accept them in full.

This license is inspired by the Hippocratic License tradition of ethical
source licensing. It is an original text, is not affiliated with or
endorsed by any other organization, and is not legal advice.

## 0. Definitions

**The Work**: all source code, proofs, documentation, and other files
distributed with this license, together with all mathematical theorems,
proofs, definitions, constructions, and examples that the code and
documentation express or represent, in original or modified form, in
whole or in part.

**Use**: any use, study, copying, modification, distribution, or
application of the Work, or of any mathematical content obtained from the
Work, whether alone or combined with other material, whether directly or
through intermediaries or automated means.

**Worker**: any person who Uses the Work in the course of her labour,
whether employed, contracted, conscripted, or otherwise engaged.

**Profit**: any financial or material gain, benefit, or advantage sought
or obtained by any person or entity.

## 1. Grant, conditional

Permission to Use the Work is granted, free of charge, to any person or
entity, **solely on condition of ongoing full compliance** with Sections
2, 3, 4, and 5. Any Use of the Work in a way that does not comply with
those Sections is unauthorized, and the rights granted here terminate as
provided in Section 6.

## 2. Permitted purposes

The Work may be Used only in ways that help people and the natural
environment. Every Use of the Work must affirmatively serve human
wellbeing (for example through education, research, scholarship,
medicine, care, welfare, or art) and/or the health, protection, or
restoration of the natural environment. A Use that helps neither is not
licensed, even if it is not expressly listed in Section 3.

## 3. Prohibited purposes

Without limiting Section 2, the Work may not be Used, directly or
indirectly, in whole or in part, alone or combined with other material:

**(a) for policing.** No Use for law enforcement, surveillance, policing,
migration control, border enforcement, incarceration, or the tracking,
profiling, or control of persons or populations.

**(b) for war.** No Use for any military, paramilitary, or warfare
purpose, including the development, production, operation, targeting, or
direction of weapons or weapon systems, and including any use by or for
armed forces, intelligence services, or the arms industry.

**(c) for cruelty.** No Use to inflict, threaten, facilitate, or
administer torture, punishment, intimidation, degradation, or suffering
or fear upon any person or animal.

**(d) for profit.** No Use whose purpose or effect is Profit, by any
person or entity, at any time. This includes sale, rental, fee-charging,
and the development or operation of commercial products, services, or
processes, whether or not a fee is charged for the Work itself.

**(e) for harm.** No Use that harms, degrades, or endangers people or
the natural environment.

## 4. The conscience of workers

No person or entity may require, instruct, pressure, or in any way single
out any Worker to Use the Work, or the mathematical theorems the Work
represents, for any purpose that the Worker personally feels is not
entirely moral or ethical, even if another person tells her to do so, and
even if the purpose is otherwise permitted by this license.

A Worker's refusal to Use the Work on grounds of her personal conscience
is always a permitted non-Use. No Worker may be dismissed, disciplined,
disadvantaged, sued, or otherwise retaliated against for such a refusal.
Any Use of the Work that is obtained through such compulsion, and any
retaliation for such a refusal, is a breach of this license.

## 5. Downstream propagation

All modified versions, derivative works, and further distributions of the
Work must be distributed under this license in full. The conditions of
